    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast Find Familiar using Pact of the Legion, you can summon a Fel Imp familiar or a Voidwalker. You also gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Quick Attack.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can command the familiar to take the Attack action.</p><p><strong>Your Spell Attack.</strong> The familiar uses your spell attack bonus for its attacks.</p><p><strong>Shadow Shield.</strong> When your Voidwalker familiar takes damage, you can take a Reaction to give it Resistance to that damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-jqTm4ot5O9mpsyEs\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The Voidwalker stat block is in D&D: World of Warcraft.</p></section>",
